    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nErvallagh is a truly unique holiday location situated between Roundstone village and the renowned white sand beaches at Gurteen and Dogs Bay. The stone built semi-ruinous property stands on a large elevated plot and fronting onto a small lake.\nIt is less than a minutes' walk to Ervallagh beach and pier. \nRoundstone is a small fishing village which has always draws visitors and holiday makers to experience one of the most stunningly beautiful settings on Irelands West Coast."
      },
